   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Checkpoint per shard so preemption loses little\n\u2022 Online traffic always wins the GPU\n\u2022 Deadline scheduling: escalate shards near 24 h\n\u2022 Sort by model, then by prompt prefix\n\u2022 Idempotent rows: custom_id per line\n\u2022 Discount works because utilisation goes up",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Checkpoint per shard so preemption loses little\n\u2022 Online traffic always wins the GPU\n\u2022 Deadline scheduling: escalate shards near 24 h\n\u2022 Sort by model, then by prompt prefix\n\u2022 Idempotent rows: custom_id per line\n\u2022 Discount works because utilisation goes up",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "q4-batch-inference-notes",
